														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">Should we focus marketing on our medical or aesthetic services?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1801" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="1" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1801"><p>Both, deliberately — they&#8217;re genuinely different revenue streams with different searchers, and marketing only one leaves real volume and revenue on the table from the other.</p></div>
