														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">How many calls does a typical clinic actually miss?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1802" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="2" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1802"><p>It varies a lot by clinic, staffing and hours. The closest published benchmark we use is from salons and spas, where Zenoti&#8217;s 2025 data found 37% of calls go unanswered. Your free audit measures your clinic&#8217;s own missed-enquiry rate rather than relying on an average.</p></div>
				</div>
