														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">Can you help us build relationships with referring GPs and insurers?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1803" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="3" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1803"><p>Yes — LinkedIn-based relationship marketing with referring doctors, corporate HR contacts and insurance coordinators is a real, underused channel we build into dermatology strategies specifically.</p></div>
				</div>
