					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1804" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="4" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1804"><p>No — it&#8217;s scoped to acknowledge enquiries, route to the right page, answer pre-approved non-clinical FAQs, and book consultations. Clinical questions are routed to the clinic&#8217;s team.</p></div>
